{
  "name": "Confounding Strikes",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the following new ways to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Charm (Cost: 2d6).</strong> The target has to succeed on a Wisddom Saving Throw or become Charmed by you for 1 minute. It can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns to end the effect.</li><li><strong>Confuse (Cost: 3d6).</strong> The target has to succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or become Confused until the end of your next turn.</li></ul>",
